# Round 27 — what Vercel does not need, and why the deploy kept aborting.
#
# The upload was 330MB and died twice mid-flight at ~250MB. Almost all of it is
# PNG evidence that no build step reads: `docs/` is 204MB of strips and
# `screenshots/` is 154MB. They are referenced ONLY in source comments, never
# imported, never opened at build or request time — the OG card and the PWA
# icons read `tailwind.config.ts`, not these directories.
#
# They stay in git, which is where the round-to-round visual record belongs.
# They simply do not need to travel to the build machine.
docs
screenshots
test-results
e2e
playwright.config.ts
